ght. The illusory appearance lasts until you use this property again or doff the armor.'),(506,'Gloves of Missile Snaring',0,0,14,1,1,'Uncommon','If you\'re hit by an attack roll made with a Ranged or Thrown weapon while wearing these gloves, you can take a Reaction to reduce the damage by 1d10 plus your Dexterity modifier if you have a free hand. If you reduce the damage to 0, you can catch the ammunition or weapon if it is small enough for you to hold in that hand.'),(507,'Gloves of Swimming and Climbing',0,0,14,1,1,'Uncommon','While wearing these gloves, you have a Climb Speed and a Swim Speed equal to your Speed, and you gain a +5 bonus to Strength (Athletics) checks made to climb or swim.'),(508,'Goggles of Night',0,0,14,1,0,'Uncommon','While wearing these dark lenses, you have Darkvision out to 60 feet. If you already have Darkvision, wearing the goggles increases its range by 60 feet.'),(509,'Greataxe (+1)',7,0,2,1,0,'Uncommon','You have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus is determined by the weapon\'s rarity.'),(510,'Greataxe (+2)',7,0,2,1,0,'Rare','You have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus is determined by the weapon\'s rarity.'),(511,'Greataxe (+3)',7,0,2,1,0,'Very Rare','You have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus is determined by the weapon\'s rarity.'),(512,'Greatclub (+1)',10,0,2,1,0,'Uncommon','You have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus is determined by the weapon\'s rarity.'),(513,'Greatclub (+2)',10,0,2,1,0,'Rare','You have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus is determined by the weapon\'s rarity.'),(514,'Greatclub (+3)',10,0,2,1,0,'Very Rare','You have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus is determined by the weapon\'s rarity.'),(515,'Greatsword of Life Stealing',6,0,2,1,1,'Rare','Wh